<Style id="route"><LineStyle><color>b31b36c4</color><width>3</width></LineStyle></Style>
<Folder><name>01 Tokyo · Nov 28 – Dec 2</name><open>1</open>
<Placemark><name>🏨 Hotel Gracery Shinjuku</name><styleUrl>#sleep</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sleep · 4 nights</b><br/>Godzilla on the roof. Narita Express stops at Shinjuku. Alt: Shibuya Stream Excel.<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hotel+Gracery+Shinjuku&query_place_id=ChIJF-U1JdiMGGARaay7KIrrtZ0'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.702034,35.695358,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Narita Airport (NRT)</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sat Nov 28 · 4:30pm</b><br/>Land. Immigration by 5:30. Buy N&#x27;EX tickets at the counter after customs.<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Narita+Airport+(NRT)'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>140.386400,35.764700,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>2. Shibuya Scramble Crossing</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sat Nov 28 · evening</b><br/>Stand in the middle of it, then watch from above.<br/>≈ 15 min by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.659482,139.700560&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 15 min by train from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.659482,139.700560&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shibuya+Scramble+Crossing&query_place_id=ChIJK9EM68qLGGARacmu4KJj5SA'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.700560,35.659482,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>3. Senso-ji</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sun Nov 29 · 6:30am</b><br/>Tokyo&#x27;s oldest temple, empty at dawn. By 10am it&#x27;s a mob.<br/>≈ 35 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.714765,139.796655&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 35 min by metro from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.714765,139.796655&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Senso-ji&query_place_id=ChIJ8T1GpMGOGGARDYGSgpooDWw'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.796655,35.714765,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. Kappabashi Kitchen Town</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sun Nov 29 · 8am</b><br/>Knives engraved with your name. Buy now, forward home in the suitcase.<br/>≈ 10 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.714765,139.796655&destination=35.710580,139.787964&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 35 min by metro from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.710580,139.787964&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kappabashi+Kitchen+Town&query_place_id=ChIJXYV-6JWOGGAR85vIZbM1RCE'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.787964,35.710580,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>5. Tsukiji Outer Market</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sun Nov 29 · 10am</b><br/>Tsukiji food tour with Ali (ex-Milos seafood chef), 10am–noon slot. Meet at the Shinran Shonin statue. Food not included: bring cash. airbnb.com/experiences/6919404<br/>≈ 20 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.710580,139.787964&destination=35.664770,139.770252&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 30 min by metro from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.664770,139.770252&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tsukiji+Outer+Market&query_place_id=ChIJW2cLzSGLGGARXAKXv6EkbqI'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.770252,35.664770,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>6. Nishikawa custom pillow (Matsuya Ginza)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sun Nov 29 · 12:30pm</b><br/>Custom-fit pillow at Nishikawa, Matsuya 7F. Walk-in OK: ~30 min fitting, ~40 min to make, so browse Ginza while it&#x27;s built.<br/>≈ 15 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.664770,139.770252&destination=35.672330,139.766762&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 30 min by metro from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.672330,139.766762&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nishikawa+custom+pillow+(Matsuya+Ginza)&query_place_id=ChIJG8GsGImLGGAR1PfGCC2k-ok'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.766762,35.672330,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>7. Ginza (Uniqlo flagship)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sun Nov 29 · 1:15pm</b><br/>12-floor Uniqlo, Itoya, depachika food halls. Pick up the pillows on the way out. Passports out for tax-free.<br/>≈ 5 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.672330,139.766762&destination=35.670245,139.763469&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 30 min by metro from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.670245,139.763469&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ginza+(Uniqlo+flagship)&query_place_id=ChIJb9MHbuaLGGAR0xi-noU25UU'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.763469,35.670245,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>8. teamLab Planets</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sun Nov 29 · 3pm</b><br/>Timed slot. Barefoot, knee-deep in projected koi. Book 3 weeks out.<br/>≈ 15 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.670245,139.763469&destination=35.649121,139.789774&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 40 min by metro from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.649121,139.789774&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=teamLab+Planets&query_place_id=ChIJSeco5wiJGGARItbTS8lQ5G0'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.789774,35.649121,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>9. Zauo Shibuya</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sun Nov 29 · 5:45pm</b><br/>Early dinner: fish your own from the boat, they cook it how you want. Reserve. Done by 7:30.<br/>≈ 40 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.649121,139.789774&destination=35.662474,139.699854&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 20 min by metro from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.662474,139.699854&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Zauo+Shibuya&query_place_id=ChIJa3cs7aiMGGAR8weY287qaJE'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.699854,35.662474,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>10. Meiji Jingu</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Nov 30 · opening</b><br/>170-acre forest in the city. Giant torii, sake barrels, quiet.<br/>≈ 15 min by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.676398,139.699326&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 15 min by train from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.676398,139.699326&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Meiji+Jingu&query_place_id=ChIJ5SZMmreMGGARcz8QSTiJyo8'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.699326,35.676398,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>11. Solakzade (vintage eyewear)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Nov 30 · 11am</b><br/>Dad&#x27;s stop: frames from the 1800s–1980s, fitted like a tailor.<br/>≈ 12 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.676398,139.699326&destination=35.668301,139.706347&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 20 min by metro from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.668301,139.706347&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Solakzade+(vintage+eyewear)&query_place_id=ChIJ07gjeKSMGGARXVe4hKptEMA'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.706347,35.668301,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>12. MixTHINKS Harajuku (vintage designer bags)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Nov 30 · 11:45am</b><br/>Vintage designer bags. Ask the condition grade (N/S/A/AB). Opens 11:30. Passports for tax-free.<br/>≈ 5 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.668301,139.706347&destination=35.667129,139.703807&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 20 min by metro from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.667129,139.703807&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=MixTHINKS+Harajuku+(vintage+designer+bags)&query_place_id=ChIJd5DukxmNGGAR0dK6sam4DIs'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.703807,35.667129,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>13. Momotaro Jeans Aoyama</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Nov 30 · 12:45pm</b><br/>Japanese selvedge denim. Free hemming while you eat (~1 hr).<br/>≈ 12 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.667129,139.703807&destination=35.663737,139.710557&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 20 min by metro from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.663737,139.710557&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Momotaro+Jeans+Aoyama&query_place_id=ChIJLcQt9l-LGGAR0dWhLQOnX-Y'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.710557,35.663737,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>14. Katsudon-ya Zuicho</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Nov 30 · 1:45pm</b><br/>Katsudon lunch, one dish, 8 seats, expect a short line. Then back to Momotaro for the hemmed jeans.<br/>≈ 20 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.663737,139.710557&destination=35.662703,139.695360&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 20 min by metro from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.662703,139.695360&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Katsudon-ya+Zuicho&query_place_id=ChIJCZkGEqyMGGAR72gGFgeNxEE'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.695360,35.662703,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>15. Street Kart Shibuya</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Nov 30 · 3pm</b><br/>Two hours in costume on real roads at dusk. Needs the International Driving Permit.<br/>≈ 20 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.662703,139.695360&destination=35.657820,139.694209&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 25 min by metro from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.657820,139.694209&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Street+Kart+Shibuya&query_place_id=ChIJAegY-QaNGGAR0t2U3IVjyyE'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.694209,35.657820,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>16. Omoide Yokocho</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Nov 30 · 7pm</b><br/>Yakitori under the train tracks.<br/>≈ 15 min by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.657820,139.694209&destination=35.692704,139.699578&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 7 min by walk from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.692704,139.699578&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Omoide+Yokocho&query_place_id=ChIJP9eKBdeMGGAR0zzBXJNVj5A'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.699578,35.692704,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>17. Golden Gai</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Nov 30 · 8:30pm</b><br/>Six alleys, 200 six-seat bars. ~¥1,000 cover each.<br/>≈ 8 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.692704,139.699578&destination=35.694112,139.704761&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 5 min by walk from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.694112,139.704761&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Golden+Gai&query_place_id=ChIJr7mGZdmMGGARjxoMFeHApXE'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.704761,35.694112,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>18. Bar Zoetrope</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Nov 30 · 9pm</b><br/>Start the whisky here, then hop.<br/>≈ 8 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.694112,139.704761&destination=35.694500,139.698463&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 6 min by walk from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.694500,139.698463&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bar+Zoetrope&query_place_id=ChIJA9cRNtaMGGARrZO3HTmHkXs'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.698463,35.694500,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Shinjuku Station</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Tue Dec 1 · 7:15am</b><br/>Fuji Excursion train, 7:30 departure. Right side faces the mountain.<br/>≈ 8 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.689607,139.700571&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 8 min by walk from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.689607,139.700571&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shinjuku+Station&query_place_id=ChIJH7qx1tCMGGAR1f2s7PGhMhw'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.700571,35.689607,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Kawaguchiko Station</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Tue Dec 1 · 9:20am</b><br/>Arrive lakeside.<br/>≈ 1h50 by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.689607,139.700571&destination=35.498236,138.768841&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kawaguchiko+Station&query_place_id=ChIJV3dIuoJgGWAR7bQ0vq8DlE0'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>138.768841,35.498236,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>21. Mt. Tenjo / Fuji Panoramic Ropeway</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Tue Dec 1 · 10am</b><br/>An hour of real climbing to a viewpoint where Fuji fills the horizon. Ropeway down.<br/>≈ 15 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.498236,138.768841&destination=35.503802,138.774378&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Mt.+Tenjo+/+Fuji+Panoramic+Ropeway&query_place_id=ChIJMZmgjCZeGWAR6wB5-jDP5Tk'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>138.774378,35.503802,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>22. Hoto Fudo</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Tue Dec 1 · 12:30pm</b><br/>Hoto: fat-noodle miso stew.<br/>≈ 15 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.503802,138.774378&destination=35.498861,138.768655&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hoto+Fudo&query_place_id=ChIJD9e0oIJgGWARjCiXDS-GJmA'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>138.768655,35.498861,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>23. Oishi Park</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Tue Dec 1 · 2pm</b><br/>Lakeshore reflection shot.<br/>≈ 25 min by bus from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.498861,138.768655&destination=35.522904,138.745752&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Oishi+Park&query_place_id=ChIJlSsLjKZfGWARBCllOgtTLqI'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>138.745752,35.522904,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>24. Kyubey Ginza</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Tue Dec 1 · 7:30pm</b><br/>Omakase at the classic counter, since 1935. Pack tonight: big bags to the front desk in the morning.<br/>≈ 20 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.689607,139.700571&destination=35.668468,139.761270&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 30 min by metro from Gracery · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.695358,139.702034&destination=35.668468,139.761270&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kyubey+Ginza&query_place_id=ChIJu3eG8uiLGGAR14kVvD_YrHI'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.761270,35.668468,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>02 Snow monkeys · Dec 2</name><open>1</open>
<Placemark><name>🏨 Shibu Hotel (Shibu Onsen)</name><styleUrl>#sleep</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sleep · 1 night</b><br/>Traditional inn, dinner + breakfast, key to all nine public bathhouses. Alt: Kokuya. Free shuttle from the station and to the monkey park.<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shibu+Hotel+(Shibu+Onsen)&query_place_id=ChIJz292noP0HWARDlUe5KLy9nY'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>138.431272,36.734406,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Tokyo Station</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Wed Dec 2 · 8am</b><br/>Hokuriku Shinkansen. Left side for the mountains. Big bags forwarded to the Kyoto hotel.<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tokyo+Station&query_place_id=ChIJC3Cf2PuLGGAROO00ukl8JwA'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.767066,35.681300,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Nagano Station</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Wed Dec 2 · 9:45am</b><br/>Bus 45 min to the trailhead.<br/>≈ 1h30 by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.681300,139.767066&destination=36.643124,138.188644&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 55 min by train from Shibu Hotel · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.734406,138.431272&destination=36.643124,138.188644&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nagano+Station&query_place_id=ChIJh0bai5KGHWARO9I7pK11KTU'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>138.188644,36.643124,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>3. Jigokudani Monkey Park</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Wed Dec 2 · 11:30am</b><br/>Bus + 30-min forest walk. 160 wild macaques in a steaming pool. Stay an hour.<br/>≈ 1h15 by bus from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.643124,138.188644&destination=36.732686,138.462136&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 20 min by metro from Shibu Hotel · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.734406,138.431272&destination=36.732686,138.462136&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jigokudani+Monkey+Park&query_place_id=ChIJzyCiTOzzHWARH9aN73OLTfY'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>138.462136,36.732686,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. Kanaguya (Spirited Away inn)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Wed Dec 2 · evening</b><br/>Look up at the six-story wooden inn next door, the Spirited Away one.<br/>≈ 2 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.734406,138.431272&destination=36.734713,138.432914&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 2 min by walk from Shibu Hotel · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.734406,138.431272&destination=36.734713,138.432914&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kanaguya+(Spirited+Away+inn)&query_place_id=ChIJb0YSwoP0HWARoFR4EcLeZPM'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>138.432914,36.734713,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>03 Kanazawa · Dec 3 – 5</name><open>1</open>
<Placemark><name>🏨 Hotel Intergate Kanazawa</name><styleUrl>#sleep</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sleep · 2 nights</b><br/>Free evening drinks, great breakfast, 15 min from the station. Alt: a restored machiya townhouse.<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hotel+Intergate+Kanazawa&query_place_id=ChIJ7UkqBf0z-F8Rf332F5I3XzM'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>136.653586,36.568240,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Yudanaka Station</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Thu Dec 3 · 8:30am</b><br/>Inn shuttle to the station, Nagaden train to Nagano.<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Yudanaka+Station'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>138.410600,36.740000,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Nagano Station</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Thu Dec 3 · 9:30am</b><br/>Bullet train through the Alps.<br/>≈ 45 min by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.740000,138.410600&destination=36.643124,138.188644&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nagano+Station&query_place_id=ChIJh0bai5KGHWARO9I7pK11KTU'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>138.188644,36.643124,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Kanazawa Station</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Thu Dec 3 · 11am</b><br/>In by 11.<br/>≈ 1h05 by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.643124,138.188644&destination=36.578044,136.648171&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 21 min by walk from Intergate · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.568240,136.653586&destination=36.578044,136.648171&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kanazawa+Station&query_place_id=ChIJBYa7A0Iz-F8R6qe7HgH2XV0'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>136.648171,36.578044,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. Nagamachi Samurai District</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Thu Dec 3 · 12:30pm</b><br/>Earthen walls, narrow lanes.<br/>≈ 8 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.568240,136.653586&destination=36.563752,136.651015&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 8 min by walk from Intergate · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.568240,136.653586&destination=36.563752,136.651015&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nagamachi+Samurai+District&query_place_id=ChIJhycOJtYz-F8RO54LaTG6_p0'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>136.651015,36.563752,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>5. Nomura-ke Samurai House</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Thu Dec 3 · 1pm</b><br/>Real samurai residence: armor, tea room, tiny perfect garden.<br/>≈ 3 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.563752,136.651015&destination=36.564206,136.650032&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 10 min by walk from Intergate · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.568240,136.653586&destination=36.564206,136.650032&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nomura-ke+Samurai+House&query_place_id=ChIJF_AqPH4z-F8Rmtm1IKiShVQ'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>136.650032,36.564206,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>6. Kenroku-en</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Thu Dec 3 · 3:30pm</b><br/>One of Japan&#x27;s three great gardens, pines in yukitsuri ropes. Go the last hour before closing.<br/>≈ 20 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.564206,136.650032&destination=36.562128,136.662652&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 19 min by walk from Intergate · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.568240,136.653586&destination=36.562128,136.662652&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kenroku-en&query_place_id=ChIJBVmy-YMz-F8R5PID8D17Cpc'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>136.662652,36.562128,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>7. Fukumitsuya Sake Brewery</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Thu Dec 3 · 6pm</b><br/>Nodoguro dinner nearby, then a sake flight at the 400-year-old brewery.<br/>≈ 15 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.562128,136.662652&destination=36.553705,136.672340&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 15 min by metro from Intergate · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.568240,136.653586&destination=36.553705,136.672340&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fukumitsuya+Sake+Brewery&query_place_id=ChIJp8mGw4oz-F8RG6DuHOB1z6Y'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>136.672340,36.553705,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Shirakawa-go Bus Terminal</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Fri Dec 4 · 9:25am</b><br/>Bus drops you at the village gate. Everything walkable.<br/>≈ 1h15 by bus from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.578044,136.648171&destination=36.261946,136.906885&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 1h25 by train from Intergate · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.568240,136.653586&destination=36.261946,136.906885&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shirakawa-go+Bus+Terminal&query_place_id=ChIJKx0Jc79x-F8RdUi6Khf_-Is'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>136.906885,36.261946,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>9. Shiroyama Viewpoint</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Fri Dec 4 · 10am</b><br/>The postcard view of 250-year-old gassho farmhouses.<br/>≈ 15 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.261946,136.906885&destination=36.263003,136.908558&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 1h25 by train from Intergate · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.568240,136.653586&destination=36.263003,136.908558&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shiroyama+Viewpoint&query_place_id=ChIJ4xHe8r9x-F8RybxsbX5Rr-o'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>136.908558,36.263003,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>10. Wada House</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Fri Dec 4 · 11am</b><br/>Go inside. Hida beef for lunch nearby.<br/>≈ 10 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.263003,136.908558&destination=36.259905,136.907635&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 1h25 by train from Intergate · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.568240,136.653586&destination=36.259905,136.907635&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Wada+House&query_place_id=ChIJdRv_s75x-F8R94Uw560g-iM'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>136.907635,36.259905,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>11. Higashi Chaya District</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Fri Dec 4 · 2:45pm</b><br/>1820s teahouse district. Gild chopsticks, eat gold-leaf ice cream.<br/>≈ 12 min by bus from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.578044,136.648171&destination=36.572583,136.666560&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 23 min by walk from Intergate · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.568240,136.653586&destination=36.572583,136.666560&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Higashi+Chaya+District&query_place_id=ChIJsfC6oXQz-F8RdA1qXiF6jLs'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>136.666560,36.572583,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>12. Omicho Market</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Fri Dec 4 · 6pm</b><br/>Counter dinner: peak snow crab, uni, sweet shrimp.<br/>≈ 15 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.572583,136.666560&destination=36.571734,136.655865&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 8 min by walk from Intergate · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.568240,136.653586&destination=36.571734,136.655865&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Omicho+Market&query_place_id=ChIJ0xPT93Az-F8RpTSlbHwo9L8'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>136.655865,36.571734,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>04 Kyoto · Dec 5 – 9</name><open>1</open>
<Placemark><name>🏨 Hotel Resol Kyoto Kawaramachi Sanjo</name><styleUrl>#sleep</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sleep · 4 nights</b><br/>Central, public bath, Nishiki Market 2 min, Pontocho out the back. Gion is a 10-min walk. Bags forwarded from Tokyo are waiting here.<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hotel+Resol+Kyoto+Kawaramachi+Sanjo&query_place_id=ChIJq2kbb5MIAWARPjnryqGzDrg'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.769220,35.007950,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Kanazawa Station</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sat Dec 5 · 8:30am</b><br/>Thunderbird express along Lake Biwa.<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kanazawa+Station&query_place_id=ChIJBYa7A0Iz-F8R6qe7HgH2XV0'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>136.648171,36.578044,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Kyoto Station</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sat Dec 5 · 11am</b><br/>≈ 2h15 by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=36.578044,136.648171&destination=34.985849,135.758767&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 20 min by metro from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=34.985849,135.758767&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kyoto+Station&query_place_id=ChIJ7wKLka4IAWARCByidG5EGrY'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.758767,34.985849,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>3. Sagano Romantic Train (Saga Torokko Sta)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sat Dec 5 · 12:15pm</b><br/>Sagano Romantic Train one way through the Hozu gorge in peak fall color. Seats open exactly 1 month out (Nov 5): Car No. 5 (open-air), right side. JR back from Umahori.<br/>≈ 35 min by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.018568,135.680782&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 35 min by train from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.018568,135.680782&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sagano+Romantic+Train+(Saga+Torokko+Sta)&query_place_id=ChIJh2v-m_6pAWAR9TR4D4O6S24'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.680782,35.018568,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. Arashiyama Bamboo Grove</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sat Dec 5 · 1:45pm</b><br/>60-ft stalks creaking in the wind.<br/>≈ 5 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.018568,135.680782&destination=35.016819,135.671301&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 40 min by metro from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.016819,135.671301&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Arashiyama+Bamboo+Grove&query_place_id=ChIJrYtcv-urAWAR3XzWvXv8n_s'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.671301,35.016819,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>5. Tenryu-ji</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sat Dec 5 · 2:15pm</b><br/>Zen garden.<br/>≈ 5 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.016819,135.671301&destination=35.015838,135.673765&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 35 min by metro from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.015838,135.673765&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tenryu-ji&query_place_id=ChIJk54PuAGqAWARwEgz_9o-nM0'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.673765,35.015838,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>6. Okochi Sanso Garden</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sat Dec 5 · 3pm</b><br/>A silent-film star&#x27;s mountain garden, tea included.<br/>≈ 8 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.015838,135.673765&destination=35.016715,135.669923&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 40 min by metro from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.016715,135.669923&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Okochi+Sanso+Garden&query_place_id=ChIJGTfQ9gSqAWARvzp3lzOgjk8'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.669923,35.016715,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>7. Nishiki Market</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sat Dec 5 · 4:30pm</b><br/>Kyoto&#x27;s kitchen: five blocks of pickles, tofu doughnuts, knives.<br/>≈ 35 min by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.016715,135.669923&destination=35.005026,135.764723&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 9 min by walk from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.005026,135.764723&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nishiki+Market&query_place_id=ChIJT8uMzZwIAWARnGzsARCjnrY'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.764723,35.005026,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>8. Samurai Kembu Theater</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sat Dec 5 · 6:30pm</b><br/>90 min: hakama on, learn to draw and cut, then the performance.<br/>≈ 10 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.009537,135.775539&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 10 min by walk from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.009537,135.775539&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Samurai+Kembu+Theater&query_place_id=ChIJXQxzcPgMAWAR2MVdzqV2kkY'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.775539,35.009537,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>9. Todai-ji (Nara)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sun Dec 6 · 10am</b><br/>45 min to Nara + a walk through the deer park. Buy deer crackers.<br/>≈ 1h by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=34.688985,135.839816&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 1h by train from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=34.688985,135.839816&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Todai-ji+(Nara)&query_place_id=ChIJ3XYIepA5AWARjzzVnT-skPg'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.839816,34.688985,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>10. Kasuga Taisha (Nara)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sun Dec 6 · noon</b><br/>Lantern-lined cedar path.<br/>≈ 15 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.688985,135.839816&destination=34.681545,135.848472&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 1h20 by train from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=34.681545,135.848472&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kasuga+Taisha+(Nara)&query_place_id=ChIJ1Wqwa8A5AWARlpXjgoPnl0w'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.848472,34.681545,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>11. Fushimi Sake Village</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sun Dec 6 · 2:30pm</b><br/>Willow canal, one counter with 18 breweries.<br/>≈ 45 min by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.681545,135.848472&destination=34.932500,135.760556&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 35 min by metro from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=34.932500,135.760556&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fushimi+Sake+Village&query_place_id=ChIJRwOaco4PAWARzaIhH6-kLG8'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.760556,34.932500,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>12. Fushimi Inari Taisha</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sun Dec 6 · 4pm</b><br/>10,000 gates. Keep going 30 min past where everyone stops. Open all night.<br/>≈ 15 min by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.932500,135.760556&destination=34.967695,135.779188&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 25 min by metro from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=34.967695,135.779188&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fushimi+Inari+Taisha&query_place_id=ChIJIW0uPRUPAWAR6eI6dRzKGns'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.779188,34.967695,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>13. Shunkoin Temple (zazen)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Dec 7 · 9am</b><br/>Zazen with the vice-abbot, in English. 90 min.<br/>≈ 30 min by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.024055,135.719507&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 30 min by train from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.024055,135.719507&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shunkoin+Temple+(zazen)&query_place_id=ChIJq7v2UZsHAWARXkzyx5VseK8'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.719507,35.024055,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>14. Ajiro (shojin ryori)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Dec 7 · 11:30am</b><br/>Shojin ryori outside the gate. Reservation required.<br/>≈ 8 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.024055,135.719507&destination=35.020851,135.721019&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 25 min by metro from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.020851,135.721019&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ajiro+(shojin+ryori)&query_place_id=ChIJc2Ej1JsHAWARDIYCJ-sh5lk'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.721019,35.020851,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>15. Kurama-dera</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Dec 7 · 1:30pm</b><br/>Mountain temple. Start the ridge hike here.<br/>≈ 55 min by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.020851,135.721019&destination=35.118140,135.770889&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 50 min by metro from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.118140,135.770889&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kurama-dera&query_place_id=ChIJnTF3sxKmAWAROIRwRX49KFA'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.770889,35.118140,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>16. Kifune Shrine</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Dec 7 · 3:30pm</b><br/>2-hour hike over the ridge through giant cedars to the red-lantern stairway.<br/>≈ 2h by hike from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.118140,135.770889&destination=35.122091,135.762910&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 50 min by metro from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.122091,135.762910&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kifune+Shrine&query_place_id=ChIJCZEK8wimAWARi1RkteQaAh0'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.762910,35.122091,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>17. Pontocho Alley</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Dec 7 · 6:30pm</b><br/>Dinner in the lantern-lit alley along the river.<br/>≈ 1h by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.122091,135.762910&destination=35.003934,135.771044&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 9 min by walk from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.003934,135.771044&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pontocho+Alley&query_place_id=ChIJP2DblBgJAWARAgLlF0vWT6o'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.771044,35.003934,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>18. Bar K6</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Dec 7 · 8:30pm</b><br/>Japanese whisky nightcap. Early-ish night.<br/>≈ 12 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.003934,135.771044&destination=35.013320,135.770556&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 11 min by walk from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.013320,135.770556&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bar+K6&query_place_id=ChIJ2b4ClM0HAWARHNrgkqv5EDI'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.770556,35.013320,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>19. Saiho-ji (Moss Temple)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Tue Dec 8 · Mom turns 50 · 9am</b><br/>Copy a sutra in ink, then the moss garden. Reservation only, booked a month out.<br/>≈ 35 min by bus from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=34.992178,135.683710&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 35 min by bus from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=34.992178,135.683710&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Saiho-ji+(Moss+Temple)&query_place_id=ChIJM3V7rDEHAWAR1bBbYdXO7K4'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.683710,34.992178,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>20. Kikunoi Honten</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Tue Dec 8 · Mom turns 50 · 12:30pm</b><br/>Three-star lunch kaiseki at half the dinner price.<br/>≈ 45 min by bus from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.992178,135.683710&destination=35.001475,135.782056&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 15 min by metro from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.001475,135.782056&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kikunoi+Honten&query_place_id=ChIJVVXF5doIAWARUetIixOU-sw'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.782056,35.001475,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>21. Gion teahouse (tea ceremony, Hanamikoji)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Tue Dec 8 · Mom turns 50 · 2:30pm</b><br/>Private tea ceremony in a Gion teahouse.<br/>≈ 8 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.001475,135.782056&destination=35.003600,135.775000&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 13 min by walk from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.003600,135.775000&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gion+teahouse+(tea+ceremony,+Hanamikoji)'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.775000,35.003600,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>22. Taiga Takahashi (T.T)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Tue Dec 8 · Mom turns 50 · 3:15pm</b><br/>Taiga Takahashi: vintage-inspired workwear in a Gion machiya, steps from the teahouse. 30 min.<br/>≈ 5 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.003600,135.775000&destination=35.001969,135.774332&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 15 min by walk from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.001969,135.774332&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Taiga+Takahashi+(T.T)&query_place_id=ChIJSVB1LIIJAWARSqg5sapwPYo'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.774332,35.001969,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>23. Ninenzaka</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Tue Dec 8 · Mom turns 50 · 3:45pm</b><br/>Stone lanes up the hill.<br/>≈ 10 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.001969,135.774332&destination=34.998399,135.780843&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 15 min by metro from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=34.998399,135.780843&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ninenzaka&query_place_id=ChIJlwyrGNAIAWARNb5hUHdZruY'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.780843,34.998399,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>24. Kiyomizu-dera</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Tue Dec 8 · Mom turns 50 · 4:15pm</b><br/>The temple on wooden stilts, at sunset.<br/>≈ 10 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.998399,135.780843&destination=34.994666,135.784661&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 15 min by metro from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=34.994666,135.784661&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kiyomizu-dera&query_place_id=ChIJB_vchdMIAWARujTEUIZlr2I'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.784661,34.994666,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>25. Gion Hatanaka (maiko dinner)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Tue Dec 8 · Mom turns 50 · 6:30pm</b><br/>The dinner. Private maiko evening, two hours, cake requested. Fill out Korea&#x27;s e-Arrival Card tonight.<br/>≈ 15 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.994666,135.784661&destination=35.002315,135.778935&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 20 min by walk from Hotel Resol · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.007950,135.769220&destination=35.002315,135.778935&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gion+Hatanaka+(maiko+dinner)&query_place_id=ChIJqWdMmsQIAWAR9LzT5fDOD7c'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.778935,35.002315,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>05 Kinosaki Onsen · Dec 9</name><open>1</open>
<Placemark><name>🏨 Nishimuraya Hotel Shogetsutei</name><styleUrl>#sleep</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sleep · 1 night</b><br/>Room with private open-air bath, matsuba crab dinner + breakfast. Shuttle from the station. Alt: Mikiya. Book first; crab season sells out.<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nishimuraya+Hotel+Shogetsutei&query_place_id=ChIJYSnGGnjJ_18RSVe5KxXSQzA'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>134.799499,35.628243,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Kyoto Station</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Wed Dec 9 · 10am</b><br/>Suitcases forwarded Kyoto → Osaka; carry-on from here through Seoul. Direct express.<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kyoto+Station&query_place_id=ChIJ7wKLka4IAWARCByidG5EGrY'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.758767,34.985849,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Kinosaki Onsen Station</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Wed Dec 9 · 12:45pm</b><br/>In by 1pm. Hotel shuttle.<br/>≈ 2h30 by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.985849,135.758767&destination=35.623761,134.813671&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 15 min by metro from Shogetsutei · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.628243,134.799499&destination=35.623761,134.813671&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kinosaki+Onsen+Station&query_place_id=ChIJ2eGnhDvI_18Rje0B1J-k_Dg'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>134.813671,35.623761,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>3. Ichino-yu (cave bath)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Wed Dec 9 · 3pm</b><br/>The cave bath. Seven public onsen are free with the room; the lantern walk between them is the point.<br/>≈ 15 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.628243,134.799499&destination=35.626176,134.809485&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 15 min by walk from Shogetsutei · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.628243,134.799499&destination=35.626176,134.809485&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ichino-yu+(cave+bath)&query_place_id=ChIJGz-LezDI_18RiRGCeYcJUk4'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>134.809485,35.626176,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>06 Osaka · Dec 10</name><open>1</open>
<Placemark><name>🏨 Cross Hotel Osaka</name><styleUrl>#sleep</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sleep · 1 night</b><br/>One block from Dotonbori. Alt: Hotel Royal Classic (kabuki-theater building, on Namba Station). Big suitcases forwarded to the Dec 13 Tokyo hotel in the morning.<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Cross+Hotel+Osaka&query_place_id=ChIJA0zO7hPnAGARHooEfgZ_MsY'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.500763,34.669715,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>1. Kinosaki Onsen Ropeway</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Thu Dec 10 · 8:30am</b><br/>1925 ropeway up the mountain, then the fishing-port stalls.<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kinosaki+Onsen+Ropeway&query_place_id=ChIJeU4pIDfI_18RsS2fCbfb3QA'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>134.803877,35.625228,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Kinosaki Onsen Station</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Thu Dec 10 · 10:15am</b><br/>10:30 Kounotori express.<br/>≈ 10 min by shuttle from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.625228,134.803877&destination=35.623761,134.813671&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kinosaki+Onsen+Station&query_place_id=ChIJ2eGnhDvI_18Rje0B1J-k_Dg'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>134.813671,35.623761,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Shin-Osaka Station</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Thu Dec 10 · 1:15pm</b><br/>Straight to the local train.<br/>≈ 2h40 by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.623761,134.813671&destination=34.733466,135.500255&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 30 min by metro from Cross Hotel · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.669715,135.500763&destination=34.733466,135.500255&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shin-Osaka+Station&query_place_id=ChIJSc4SbDnkAGARz3YQv-DE1zs'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.500255,34.733466,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. Suntory Yamazaki Distillery</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Thu Dec 10 · 2pm</b><br/>Where Japanese whisky was born. Tour is a lottery 2 months out; tasting counter takes a reservation.<br/>≈ 30 min by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.733466,135.500255&destination=34.892457,135.674451&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 1h05 by train from Cross Hotel · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.669715,135.500763&destination=34.892457,135.674451&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Suntory+Yamazaki+Distillery&query_place_id=ChIJ-WxR9WMDAWARHW0W4OC39qE'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.674451,34.892457,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>5. B.B. Garage (vintage watches)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Thu Dec 10 · 5:15pm</b><br/>Vintage watches at the back of the shop (open till 8, closed Wed). Ask if it&#x27;s been overhauled and if the dial/hands are original.<br/>≈ 8 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.669715,135.500763&destination=34.670307,135.498575&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 8 min by walk from Cross Hotel · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.669715,135.500763&destination=34.670307,135.498575&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=B.B.+Garage+(vintage+watches)&query_place_id=ChIJ62Sj0EznAGARLILmS20T5LM'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.498575,34.670307,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>6. Dotonbori</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Thu Dec 10 · 6:30pm</b><br/>The canal, the Glico man, kushikatsu and takoyaki standing up. Early night: 7am airport train.<br/>≈ 10 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.670307,135.498575&destination=34.668647,135.503098&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 4 min by walk from Cross Hotel · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.669715,135.500763&destination=34.668647,135.503098&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Dotonbori&query_place_id=ChIJg2DcJhXnAGARCbeAHoZrPeQ'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.503098,34.668647,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>07 Seoul · Dec 11 – 13</name><open>1</open>
<Placemark><name>🏨 Nine Tree by Parnas Insadong</name><styleUrl>#sleep</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sleep · 2 nights</b><br/>Insadong: walkable to the palace, Bukchon and Gwangjang. Alt: Hotel Kukdo. Use Naver Map or KakaoMap here; Google Maps can&#x27;t route walking or driving in Korea.<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nine+Tree+by+Parnas+Insadong&query_place_id=ChIJYRZuA-KjfDUR3EIotimBRBQ'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>126.983207,37.574639,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Namba Station (airport express)</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Fri Dec 11 · 6:50am</b><br/>7am airport express (45 min).<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Namba+Station+(airport+express)'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.502100,34.662700,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Kansai International Airport (KIX)</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Fri Dec 11 · 7:45am</b><br/>Morning flight to Incheon, 2h.<br/>≈ 45 min by train from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.662700,135.502100&destination=34.431999,135.236602&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kansai+International+Airport+(KIX)&query_place_id=ChIJ9_rNIxO5AGARiI-QjZ-ncfE'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>135.236602,34.431999,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Incheon International Airport (ICN)</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Fri Dec 11 · 11am</b><br/>Through immigration by noon with the e-Arrival Card. Airport express into the city.<br/>≈ 2h by flight from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=34.431999,135.236602&destination=37.458666,126.441968&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 1h40 by train from Nine Tree · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.574639,126.983207&destination=37.458666,126.441968&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Incheon+International+Airport+(ICN)&query_place_id=ChIJWfpeOoOaezUR1L5cy5agS40'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>126.441968,37.458666,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. Gyeongbokgung Palace</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Fri Dec 11 · 2pm</b><br/>Rent hanbok by the gate (free palace entry). The photo op of the trip. Non-negotiable.<br/>≈ 15 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.574639,126.983207&destination=37.579617,126.977041&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 15 min by walk from Nine Tree · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.574639,126.983207&destination=37.579617,126.977041&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gyeongbokgung+Palace&query_place_id=ChIJod7tSseifDUR9hXHLFNGMIs'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>126.977041,37.579617,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>5. Bukchon Hanok Village</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Fri Dec 11 · 4pm</b><br/>Hanok houses on the hillside, skyline behind.<br/>≈ 15 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.579617,126.977041&destination=37.581470,126.984952&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 14 min by walk from Nine Tree · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.574639,126.983207&destination=37.581470,126.984952&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bukchon+Hanok+Village&query_place_id=ChIJT8H4r9qifDURmuXJ_6m6vM0'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>126.984952,37.581470,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>6. Jogyesa Temple</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Fri Dec 11 · 5pm</b><br/>Seoul&#x27;s main Buddhist temple: painted eaves, thousands of lanterns.<br/>≈ 12 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.581470,126.984952&destination=37.573837,126.982202&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 2 min by walk from Nine Tree · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.574639,126.983207&destination=37.573837,126.982202&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jogyesa+Temple&query_place_id=ChIJHYhJ5OmifDURMOSQ2D-6lFY'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>126.982202,37.573837,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>7. Gwangjang Market</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Fri Dec 11 · 6:30pm</b><br/>1905 covered market: bindaetteok, yukhoe, knife-cut noodles on plastic stools.<br/>≈ 20 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.573837,126.982202&destination=37.570039,126.999604&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 15 min by metro from Nine Tree · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.574639,126.983207&destination=37.570039,126.999604&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gwangjang+Market&query_place_id=ChIJm3V0fu2ifDURRJ8IMUijVtY'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>126.999604,37.570039,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>8. Myeongdong Street</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Fri Dec 11 · 8pm</b><br/>Street-food stalls.<br/>≈ 15 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.570039,126.999604&destination=37.563770,126.984476&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 22 min by walk from Nine Tree · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.574639,126.983207&destination=37.563770,126.984476&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Myeongdong+Street&query_place_id=ChIJXz2vx_GifDURImd3aTJZ1VA'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>126.984476,37.563770,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>9. Olive Young Myeongdong Town</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Fri Dec 11 · 9pm</b><br/>The K-beauty haul. Tax-free with passport.<br/>≈ 3 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.563770,126.984476&destination=37.563946,126.985162&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 22 min by walk from Nine Tree · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.574639,126.983207&destination=37.563946,126.985162&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Olive+Young+Myeongdong+Town&query_place_id=ChIJ9XDV4O-ifDURKjI94KEc1h4'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>126.985162,37.563946,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>10. Gangnam Station (skin clinic area)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sat Dec 12 · 9:30am</b><br/>Skin clinic (laser toning, Rejuran). Then personal color analysis. Book 2–4 weeks ahead, English sessions.<br/>≈ 35 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.574639,126.983207&destination=37.497952,127.027619&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 35 min by metro from Nine Tree · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.574639,126.983207&destination=37.497952,127.027619&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gangnam+Station+(skin+clinic+area)&query_place_id=ChIJKxs2jFmhfDURPP--kvKavw0'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>127.027619,37.497952,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>11. Dragon Hill Spa</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sat Dec 12 · 2pm</b><br/>Jjimjilbang: salt room, clay room, ice room, kiln eggs, seshin scrub. The co-ed spa day. ~3 hours.<br/>≈ 30 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.497952,127.027619&destination=37.528165,126.964388&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 25 min by metro from Nine Tree · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.574639,126.983207&destination=37.528165,126.964388&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Dragon+Hill+Spa&query_place_id=ChIJiVvysQGifDURayzTq-wONHc'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>126.964388,37.528165,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>12. Seongsu-dong (alt afternoon)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sat Dec 12 · alt</b><br/>Alt afternoon if the clinic runs long: Seongsu-dong cafés and pop-ups.<br/>≈ 45 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.528165,126.964388&destination=37.540685,127.056632&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 35 min by metro from Nine Tree · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.574639,126.983207&destination=37.540685,127.056632&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Seongsu-dong+(alt+afternoon)&query_place_id=ChIJgQD8o5OkfDUR6b0_C5FwjNk'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>127.056632,37.540685,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>13. N Seoul Tower</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sat Dec 12 · 9pm</b><br/>Night view option 1: the tower on the hill. (Option 2: Seoul Sky, 123 floors, ~40 min away.)<br/>≈ 30 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.574639,126.983207&destination=37.551169,126.988227&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 30 min by metro from Nine Tree · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.574639,126.983207&destination=37.551169,126.988227&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=N+Seoul+Tower&query_place_id=ChIJqWqOqFeifDURpYJ5LnxX-Fw'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>126.988227,37.551169,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>08 Tokyo, last night · Dec 13 – 14</name><open>1</open>
<Placemark><name>🏨 Hotel Metropolitan Tokyo Marunouchi</name><styleUrl>#sleep</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sleep · 1 night</b><br/>On top of Tokyo Station, where the Narita Express leaves from. Suitcases forwarded from Osaka are waiting at the desk.<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hotel+Metropolitan+Tokyo+Marunouchi&query_place_id=ChIJkwDaxf6LGGARl7WXPY_ic9A'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.768570,35.683897,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Incheon International Airport (ICN)</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sun Dec 13 · 12:30pm</b><br/>Insadong café morning, checkout at 11, airport express. Early-afternoon flight to Narita (not Haneda).<br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Incheon+International+Airport+(ICN)&query_place_id=ChIJWfpeOoOaezUR1L5cy5agS40'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>126.441968,37.458666,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Narita Airport (NRT)</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sun Dec 13 · 4:30pm</b><br/>Land. Narita Express to Tokyo Station, 1 hour.<br/>≈ 2h30 by flight from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=37.458666,126.441968&destination=35.764700,140.386400&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 1h55 by train from Metropolitan · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.683897,139.768570&destination=35.764700,140.386400&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Narita+Airport+(NRT)'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>140.386400,35.764700,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>3. Sushi Yuu (Nishiazabu)</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Sun Dec 13 · 8pm</b><br/>The second omakase, a tier up. English-speaking chef. Pack it all tonight.<br/>≈ 25 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.683897,139.768570&destination=35.661835,139.725206&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 25 min by metro from Metropolitan · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.683897,139.768570&destination=35.661835,139.725206&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sushi+Yuu+(Nishiazabu)&query_place_id=ChIJ13sWRHqLGGARX9fpN_Tkxfc'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.725206,35.661835,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. Tsukiji Outer Market</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Dec 14 · 8:30am</b><br/>One last market breakfast.<br/>≈ 15 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.683897,139.768570&destination=35.664770,139.770252&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 15 min by metro from Metropolitan · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.683897,139.768570&destination=35.664770,139.770252&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tsukiji+Outer+Market&query_place_id=ChIJW2cLzSGLGGARXAKXv6EkbqI'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.770252,35.664770,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>5. Imperial Palace East Garden</name><styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Dec 14 · 10am</b><br/>Five minutes from the hotel. Check out by noon.<br/>≈ 15 min by metro from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.664770,139.770252&destination=35.686782,139.757145&travelmode=transit'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 19 min by walk from Metropolitan · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.683897,139.768570&destination=35.686782,139.757145&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Imperial+Palace+East+Garden&query_place_id=ChIJPfFaQhOMGGAR-QPbNQoAG6M'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.757145,35.686782,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Tokyo Station</name><styleUrl>#transit</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mon Dec 14 · 2:30pm</b><br/>2:45 Narita Express.<br/>≈ 3 min by walk from the previous stop · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.683897,139.768570&destination=35.681300,139.767066&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/>≈ 3 min by walk from Metropolitan · <a href='https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&origin=35.683897,139.768570&destination=35.681300,139.767066&travelmode=walking'>Directions</a><br/><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tokyo+Station&query_place_id=ChIJC3Cf2PuLGGAROO00ukl8JwA'>Open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.767066,35.681300,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
